      "comment": "ZIPPING WICHITA (2) is yet to miss the placings here in an excellent record which boasts two wins and three placings. Placed last time (31.24) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 2 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. ZIPPING WINDSOR (1) was strongly supported last start but missed the frame when fourth (31.32), beaten 3.5 lengths. Has ability and can measure up. BRAX KEEPING (8) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Gawler in a handy 30.66 beating Mundulla. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Will go close again if runs up to latest. ",
